nginx-load-balancing is the NGINX (OSS + Plus) load-balancer / reverse-proxy / Kubernetes-ingress skill
in the load-balancer family (PR 2 of 2). It is scoped to NGINX's load-balancing role, NOT general
web-server hosting. The design and platform-selection decision lives in load-balancer-selection (PR 1).
Skill licensed MIT (the primary-source licence).

